15. Kh1 h2 (15... Kf2 16. Kh2 Kf3 17. Kxh3) *


[Event "100 Endgames You Must Know by Jesus de la Villa: Ending 5: Imprisoning the stronger side's king (1.16)"]
[Date "2022.10.14"]
[Result "*"]
[Variant "Standard"]
