1. Bb5+ { We start with a check to activate our bishop and force the king to define his position. } (1. e7 Bxe7 2. fxe7 { e7 immediately draws to the bishop sacrifice. }) (1. f7+ Ke7 { f7 also draws, as there is no way to remove the blockade on the dark squares. }) 1... Kd8 2. Kf5 { And now we outflank the other king, to guard the promotion square. } 2... Bc5 3. Kg6 Bb4 4. Kf7 Bc5 5. e7+ { And now we support the promotion, 1-0. } *


