{ Extreme position, rook behind the pawns. The side to move wins easily. White plays 1.b6 or a7 and promotes, and if black is to move then Ra1 is easy.

If the rook is in front of the pawns, it can stop them but not capture them, ex rook on a8 stops either pawn from pushing, then the king race decides. } { [%csl Ga8] }
